title: "Yale Cardiac POCUS View Classifier"
abstract: >-
  An emergency-department-native echocardiographic view classifier with a
  non-cardiac gate and a (preliminary) orientation head, for triaging
  point-of-care ultrasound loops before downstream cardiology-trained models.
